  "description": "Linkdev Umbraco Cropper is a powerful and flexible image cropper package built for Umbraco 7, 8, and 9, developed by Link Development. It enables content editors to manage image crops efficiently within the Umbraco backoffice while supporting integration with private Azure Blob Storage containers, making it ideal for enterprise-level and cloud-hosted projects.\n\n✅ Key Features:\n📦 Umbraco 7, 8, and 9 support\n\n✂️ Define custom crop sizes (e.g., thumbnails, banners, cards)\n\n🧑‍💻 Seamless integration with Azure Storage (private containers)\n\n🔐 Secure access to media files using custom IImageService\n\n🖼 Built-in UI for cropping and previewing in the media picker\n\n📱 Supports responsive image strategies via multiple crop definitions\n\n🌐 Azure Integration Highlights:\nFully compatible with Azure Blob Storage, including private containers\n\nCustomize and register your own IImageService implementation to authenticate and retrieve images securely\n\nWorks with ImageProcessor to handle remote images without compromising access control\n\n🔧 Use Cases:\nCloud-native websites hosted on Azure App Service\n\nProjects that store media securely in private Azure containers\n\nEnterprise applications requiring centralized media management\n\nWhether you're working with legacy Umbraco 7 or the .NET Core-based Umbraco 9, Linkdev Umbraco Cropper provides a unified solution for managing and displaying images securely and consistently.",
